				<wikidot:authorName>Merkab</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1450763</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>As a huge Asimov fan, I would have to say that this is an extraordinary adaptation of this theme of story. I could see a little polish or meat to make this better, but as is, it is easily my favorite Tale on this site.</p> <p>The way she evolves from knowing nothing of what she should or could do, to someone who knew of everything that is and is not is fantastic, even showing how her teachings stuck with her.</p> <p>This whole canon has been magnificent, and has just been crowned with the best story yet.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
